    "送り出す": "Send out",
    "ボタンひとつで出発。冒険者は本物のAI。戦場ではあなたの手を離れ、自分で考えて動きます。": "Depart with one button. Your adventurer is a real AI. Out on the battlefield it's out of your hands, thinking and acting on its own.",
    "みんなの冒険者がそろってボスに挑む様子を、ドット絵のアニメで見届ける。講評をヒントに鍛え直して、また挑戦。": "Watch everyone's adventurers take on the boss together in pixel-art animation. Use the guild master's review as a hint, train again, and take another shot.",
