    "キャラ図鑑": "Character compendium",
    "冒険者の見た目は自由に選べます。種族や職業、服の色、手に持つ武器、連れて歩くお供まで。強さには関係ないので、好きな姿で。": "You can freely choose your adventurer's look: species and profession, clothing color, the weapon in hand, even the companion that tags along. None of it affects strength, so go with whatever you like.",
