    "{0}　荷物の重さ {1}/{2}": "{0}  Pack weight {1}/{2}",
    "採点時の消費: 入力 {0} / 出力 {1} トークン（約 ${2}）": "Used in grading: input {0} / output {1} tokens (about ${2})",
    "くわしい診断（場面の種類ごとの正解数）": "Detailed diagnosis (correct answers by scene type)",
    "非公開の問題の中身は出しません。種類ごとの正解数と、ビルドに足りないものだけを見せています。": "The contents of the private questions are never shown. Only the number of correct answers per type, and what the build lacks, are shown.",
