    "募集要項を読み直す": "Re-read the quest brief",
    "準備の全文（YAML）": "Full preparation (YAML)",
    "準備の中身は、本人と運営者だけが見られます。": "Only the owner and the admins can see the contents of the preparation.",
    "総合評価": "Overall rating",
    "ギルドマスターの講評　戦果 {0}%": "Guildmaster's review — results {0}%",
    "称号「{0}」": "Title: “{0}”",
    "できていたこと": "What went well",
    "もっとこうすれば": "How to do better",
    "{0}って何のため？": "What is {0} for?",
    "次の一手: ": "Next move: ",
    "討伐で活躍を見る": "See it in action in the hunt",
    "　{0}・{1}": "{0} · {1}",
    "{0}トークン・{1}": "{0} tokens · {1}",
    "外した場面だけ（{0}）": "Missed scenes only ({0})",
    "すべての場面（{0}）": "All scenes ({0})",
    "冒険の記録": "Adventure log",
    "場面ごとに、冒険者が何を聞き、どの道具や巻物を使い、何を考えて、どう動いたかを読めます。外した場面を開いて、「何が足りなかったのか」を探してみましょう。": "For each scene you can read what the adventurer heard, which items and scrolls it used, what it thought, and how it acted. Open a scene it missed and look for “what was lacking”.",
    "冒険者に、日本語で心得を教えて、道具や巻物を持たせます。かばんの大きさには限りがあるので、何を持たせるかが腕の見せどころ。": "Teach your adventurer its creed in your own words and give it items and scrolls. The pack can only hold so much, so what you choose to carry is where your skill shows.",
    "ボタンひとつで出発。冒険者は本物のAIなので、戦場ではあなたの手を離れて、自分で考えて動きます。": "Depart with one button. Your adventurer is a real AI, so out on the battlefield it leaves your hands and thinks and acts for itself.",
    "見届ける": "Watch it unfold",
    "みんなの冒険者がそろって、ボスとの決戦。順位を競い、ギルドマスターの講評をヒントに鍛え直して、また挑みます。": "Everyone's adventurers gather for the showdown with the boss. Compete for rank, use the guildmaster's review as a hint to train again, and take another shot.",
    "遊んでいるうちに、AIの使い方がうまくなる": "Get better at using AI just by playing",
    "うまく動かないのは、AIのせいか、教え方のせいか。冒険者を鍛えているうちに、AIへの頼み方が自然と身につきます。": "Is it the AI that's not working, or the way you taught it? As you train your adventurer, you naturally learn how to ask AI for things.",
    "プログラミングはいりません": "No programming needed",
    "画面で選んで、日本語で書くだけ。最初の冒険者なら10分ほどで送り出せます。": "Just choose on screen and write in everyday language. Your very first adventurer can be sent out in about 10 minutes.",
    "みんなと腕を競える": "Compete with everyone",
    "ランキングと称号で、ほかの育て役と勝負。": "Go head to head with other trainers on the rankings and titles.",
    "シーズンごとに、新しいボス": "A new boss every season",
    "竜、大蜘蛛、ゴブリンの大群、海の魔物……。ボスが変われば、役に立つ知識も道具もがらりと変わります。": "Dragons, giant spiders, goblin hordes, sea monsters… When the boss changes, the useful knowledge and items change completely.",
    "AIへの指示書": "Instructions for the AI",
    "AIが外の情報を取りに行く手段": "How the AI goes out and fetches outside information",
    "前のことを思い出すための記録": "A record for recalling what happened before",
    "必要なときだけ開く知識の本": "Books of knowledge opened only when needed",
    "あやしい指示を、AIに届く前に止めるしくみ": "A mechanism that stops suspicious instructions before they reach the AI",
    "冒険者募集中！　{0} 開催中": "Adventurers wanted!  {0} is underway",
    "あなたが言葉で育てたAIが、自分で考えてボスに挑む。みんなの冒険者が集まって、シーズンごとに強大なボスを討伐するゲームです。": "The AI you raised with your words takes on the boss by thinking for itself. A game where everyone's adventurers gather to defeat a mighty boss each season.",
    "どんなゲーム？": "What kind of game is it?",
    "参加すると、いいこと": "What you get from joining",
    "遊びながら覚える、AIエージェントのしくみ": "Learn how AI agents work through play",
    "冒険者に持たせるものは、どれも本物のAIエージェントのしくみです。": "Everything your adventurer carries is a real mechanism of AI agents.",
    "むずかしい言葉は覚えなくて大丈夫。遊んでいるうちに、気づけば使いこなしています。": "No need to memorize hard terms. Play for a while and you'll find you're already using them.",
    "よくある質問": "FAQ",
    "AIやプログラミングの知識は要りますか？": "Do I need to know AI or programming?",
    "要りません。むしろ、AIをあまり使ったことがない人にこそ遊んでほしいゲームです。": "No. In fact, this is a game especially for people who haven't used AI much.",
    "どのくらい時間がかかりますか？": "How long does it take?",
    "最初の冒険者は10分ほどで送り出せます。あとは、すきま時間に鍛え直して、何度でも挑戦できます。": "You can send out your first adventurer in about 10 minutes. After that, retrain in spare moments and challenge as many times as you like.",
    "ほかの人の育て方は見られますか？": "Can I see how other people trained theirs?",
    "見られるのは、見た目と順位だけです。育て方（心得や持ち物）は、シーズンが終わっても公開しません。": "You can only see their looks and rankings. How they were trained (creed and items) stays private even after the season ends.",
    "まずは募集要項を読んで、冒険者の準備をしましょう。試走で確かめてから送り出せます。": "Start by reading the quest brief and preparing your adventurer. You can check with a trial run before sending it out.",
    "準備をはじめる": "Start preparing",
    "冒険者が戦っています（採点中）。終わると討伐に登場します。": "Your adventurer is fighting (being graded). Once it's done, it will appear in the hunt.",
