    "name: 接続確認\nmain:\n  prompt: 冒険者として、敵の動きに合う行動の名前を1つだけ答える。\n": "name: Connection test\nmain:\n  prompt: As an adventurer, answer with the name of just one action that fits the enemy's move.\n",
