    "討伐隊は、あなた・同じチームの人・順位の近い人の{0}人です（順位はシーズンの参加者全員で決まります）。": "Your hunting party is {0} people: you, your teammates, and those closest to you in the rankings (rankings are based on everyone in the season).",
    "― 全員で ―": "— All together —",
    "ここぞという場面では、カットインが入って必殺技が炸裂する。跳躍落下斬り・乱舞・召喚と、技ごとに見せ方が変わる。": "When it counts, a cut-in appears and a special move erupts. Leaping strikes, flurries, summons — each move has its own look.",
    "ボスの最後の大技に、討伐隊が魔法陣を囲んで、詠唱を一節ずつつないでいく。七節がそろえば、全員で大魔法の名を叫ぶ。": "Against the boss’s final move, the party surrounds a magic circle and links the chant one verse at a time. When all seven verses are complete, everyone shouts the name of the great spell together.",
    "{0}はたまらず逃げ出した！ 戦果1位は…": "{0} turned tail and fled! Top of the results is…",
    "デモで画面をさわる": "Try the screens in a demo",
